@sheet Metrics [markdown]
| label | value |
| ----- | ----: |
| latency | 120 |
| uptime | 99 |
| incidents | 2 |

@sheet Bench [json]
[
  { "target": 100, "floor": 95 }
]

@sheet Summary
-Metric-Value-
| Latency gap | =Metrics!B2-Bench!A2 |
| Uptime gap | =Metrics!B3-Bench!B2 |
| Status | =IF(B2>0,"Watch","OK") |

@sheet Notes
-Metric-Value-
| Copy | =Summary!B4 |
| Gap | =Summary!B2 |
